 * (context: parser tests for the INTERPOLATEDS extension, derived from the
 * IFJ26 spec, section 5.6; an interpolated string is built as a concatenation
 * of its parts with +, every $id and ${expr} is wrapped in a call of toStr,
 * as the spec converts every inserted value the same way as toStr does)
